SUMMARY:Columbia Dance Spring Showcase
DESCRIPTION:Columbia Dance Spring Showcase\nMay 23–24\, 2026 \nJoin us as Columbia Dance students take the stage to showcase all they’ve learned this year! Watch the trailer: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=85Qn83qDApg&t=10s \nPerformance Times (4 total): \n\nSaturday\, May 23 at 2:00 PM\nSaturday\, May 23 at 5:00 PM\nSunday\, May 24 at 2:00 PM\nSunday\, May 24 at 5:00 PM\n\nAdult $20\, Senior/Youth $15 \nLocation:\nSkyview Concert Hall (Skyview High School)\n1300 NW 139th St\, Vancouver\, WA 98685 \nAbout the Performances: \n\n2:00 PM shows (approx. 1 hour): Featuring our youngest dancers through intermediate levels—an opportunity to see early confidence\, growth\, and joy on stage.\n5:00 PM shows (approx. 1.5 hours): Showcasing intermediate and advanced dancers in a dynamic program including ballet\, jazz\, and modern works. Many of these dancers go on to pursue professional careers\, making this a special opportunity to see their artistry and dedication.\n\nContact:\nGeneral questions: info@columbiadance.org | 360-737-1922\nTicket questions: box-office@columbiadance.org \nWe hope you’ll join us in celebrating our dancers! \nEditor’s note: This event is a community submission.
URL:https://pdxparent.com/event-single/columbia-dance-spring-showcase/2026-05-23/
LOCATION:Skyview Concert Hall\, 1300 NW 139th Street\, Vancouver\, WA
CATEGORIES:Dance,Family Fun,Indoor,Kids Calendar,Theater
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://pdxparent.com/wp-content/uploads/columbia-dance-project.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Columbia Dance":MAILTO:info@columbiadance.org
END:VEVENT
