SUMMARY:THPRD Splash Pads Opening Day & First Few Weekends
DESCRIPTION:THPRD’s splash pads are scheduled to open on May 22 for the 2026 summer season! With sunny skies and warmer temperatures in the forecast\, it’s the perfect time to cool off and enjoy some water fun!\n\n\n\nWhere to splash:\n– Cedar Hills Park\n– Timberland Park\n– Reflections Plaza\n– Conestoga Recreation & Aquatic Center (drop-in fees apply)
