SUMMARY:Multnomah County Fair & La Familia Day
DESCRIPTION:The Multnomah County Fair will take place May 23 – 25\, 2026 at Oaks Amusement Park! The fair features three full days of family fun including competitive exhibits\, musical and stage performances\, Portland’s Lucha Libre – Wrestling\, pioneer village\, as well as small animal activities. In addition\, to all the fair activities\, visitors can also enjoy the awesome amusement rides at Oaks Amusement Park plus all the delicious fair foods that you can imagine! \nLa Familia Day activities will take place on May 24\, 2026! Celebrating culture through the magic of music\, dance\, and traditional family games…Aztec dancers\, traditional cultural dances\, and surprises to delight children of all ages. FREE Loteria (BINGO)\, a favorite Mexican family game will be offered all day! You can also enjoy the exciting thrill rides\, check out local vendors and food booths. Creative Fair life crafts will be featured throughout the fair grounds. \nPricing:\nAdmission: FREE (Additional cost for amusement rides)\nParking: Oaks Park charges $4
URL:https://pdxparent.com/event-single/multnomah-county-fair-la-familia-day/2026-05-25/
LOCATION:Oaks Amusement Park\, 7805 SE Oaks Park Way\, Portland\, OR\, 97202
CATEGORIES:Active,Family Fun,Festival,Kids Calendar,Outdoor
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://pdxparent.com/wp-content/uploads/Multnomah-County-Fair.png
END:VEVENT
